                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
            interactions with the potential interspersed with evolving freely between the interactions, and we integrate over all possible times at which those interactions could occur.
          %p
            Here’s an example
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Feynman+diagram"} Feynman diagram
            for this simple system, representing the fourth term in the sum above:
          %p{:style => "text-align:center;"}
            %img.size-full.wp-image-798{:alt => "Three interactions with the perturbation.", :height => "200", :src => "http://reperiendi.wordpress.com/files/2009/10/3.gif", :title => "3", :width => "10"}/
          %p
