                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %mi g
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \exp(-A/g)
            are the contributions of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instantons"} instantons
            (
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
            is the contribution of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instanton"} instanton
            = succeed ")." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+functional"} action functional
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derivatives"} derivatives
            of the function
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi g
                  %mo ↦
                  %msup
